### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### Get one contact by valid ID
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6a97a7a7591c810f241b8dde

### Get contact with INVALID ID format (Should return 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/invalid-id-123

### Create contact (Valid)
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "James",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "1990-01-01"
}

### Create contact with INVALID data (Should return 400 with error list)
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "",
    "lastName": "",
    "email": "not-an-email",
    "favoriteColor": "",
    "birthday": "01-01-1990"
}

